Name:Rules pilot 294 - Deathtouch does not stop trample
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:You are at 2 life. The opponent's Colossal Dreadmaw (6/6 trample) and Grizzly Bears (2/2) are attacking you. You control Typhoid Rats (1/1 deathtouch) and Wall of Stone (0/8). Survive the turn.
Rule:authored-trample-deathtouch-blocker | A trampler need assign only lethal damage to its blocker, the blocker's toughness, before the rest goes to the player (CR 702.19b, 120.6); the blocker's deathtouch changes nothing, since all combat damage is dealt at once (CR 510.2): the Rats would let 5 through, the Wall's 8 toughness lets none
